WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.200
I clearly...

00:03.600 --> 00:05.400
I gave Old Man Liu my word

00:06.600 --> 00:09.500
That I would take care of you for a lifetime...

00:10.200 --> 00:12.500
I broke my promise.

00:15.800 --> 00:17.600
If I depart,

00:19.400 --> 00:22.120
You will truly be left all alone.
